SUMMARY:Cards on the Coast: Sports Card & TCG Show
DESCRIPTION:Two hundred tables of sports cards and trading card games fill
  a hall on the UWF campus\, with more than a hundred vendors in from five
  states to buy\, sell and trade. Anyone fifteen and under gets in free\, 
 so a kid can work a table with five dollars and come out with something. 
 The vendor list runs from vintage baseball to Pokémon: DJ's Vintage Card
 s and Collectibles\, Big Hit Sportscards\, Card Sharks and Bargain Sports
  Collectibles on the sports side\, PokéPal Collectibles and 850 Pokestop
  on the TCG side\, and PCOLABREAKS running breaks. The organisers run thi
 s show at the same building each time and put a share of it behind the Ra
 lly Foundation\, which funds childhood cancer research.\nPrice: from $5\n
 Area: Pensacola\nTimes: Saturday · 9:00 AM-4:00 PM\nChecked against the 
